  "description": "Audio-stage abstractions for the Voxa pipeline — the seams that sit on the mic path before the VAD. Defines IEchoCanceller (VRT-003, acoustic echo cancellation for barge-in over speakers) and IAudioEnhancer (VLS-004, spectral denoise), each with a passthrough default and a FrameProcessor. Ships the seams, not the DSPs/models.",
